{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"类型论"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"类型论"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"学科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>类型论是一种关于 “元素” 与 “类型” 的形式语言, 适于作为"},{"Local":{"url":"数学基础","text":"数学基础"}},{"Plain":", 以及作为范畴的"},{"Local":{"url":"内语言","text":"内语言"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"tutorial-type-theory","text":"教程 : 类型论"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>分支:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"同伦类型论","text":"同伦类型论"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}